In view of my foregoing reasons, I proceed the pass the following;
ORDER Acting under Section 235(1) of Cr.P.C, the accused Nos.1 and 2 are hereby acquitted for the offences punishable under Sections 498(A), 323, 504, 506 of IPC & sec.4 of DP Act, &
u/s.3(1)(r),(s),(z) of the SC/ST POA) Act, 1989.

